{{Armor Passive Info Panel|{{PAGENAME}}}}

== Explanation ==
A versatile jack-of-all-trades effect that grants [[damage]] resistance to:
*Fire – including [[Helldiver]]s, [[Incineration Corps]], or [[fire tornados]]
*Gas – Helldivers
*Acid – [[Terminids]]
*Electrical (arc) – Helldivers and [[Illuminate]]

