Alexus Defibrillator Quote.png|Alexus explaining the use of this armor-passive
</gallery>

==Issues==

If the wearer is a client in another player's lobby, the last stand will sometimes activate upon taking non-lethal damage. This frequency of this issue depends on the connection between the client and the host. <ref>[https://www.reddit.com/r/Helldivers/comments/1w08w2h/update_on_the_adrenodefib_revive_bug/ Reddit post detailing the premature revive bug]</ref>

