{{Armor Passive Info Panel|{{PAGENAME}}}}

==Explanation==
<span style=color:var(--wiki-heading-color)>'''1.'''</span>
Your {{Tooltip|CQC|close-quarters combat}} becomes 40% more deadly — whether it's butt-strokes, [[pistol]]-whips, bayonet thrusts, melee swings, or [[This Is Democracy|kicks]]. This damage increase affects both normal damage as well as [[Damage#Enemy_Durability_&_Durable_Damage|durable damage]].
